The game uses MySQL/MariaDB.
The schema is defined in \fBsite/db/Game.sql\fR.
Module data is loaded from CSV files via \fBLoadModule.sql\fR scripts.
Core data (help topics) is loaded via \fBsite/db/core/Load.sql\fR.
.PP
Key tables: \fBgames\fR, \fBships\fR, \fBdrafts\fR, \fBcombat_state\fR,
\fBcombat_orders\fR, \fBpending_damage\fR, \fBstar_systems\fR,
\fBwarplines\fR, \fBsystem_resources\fR, \fBcodex_entries\fR,
\fBmarket_prices\fR, \fBfacility_control\fR, \fBhex_events\fR,
\fBaa_metrics\fR, \fBsaved_games\fR.
